# Sites that block automated requests, so lychee cannot check them.
# Patterns are regular expressions matched against the full URL.
# cf. https://lychee.cli.rs/recipes/excluding-links/

# Returns 999 to all non-browser clients
^https://www\.linkedin\.com/
# Returns 403 to all scripted requests (AWS WAF), even for the homepage
^https://datascience\.wisc\.edu/
# Returns 403 to all scripted requests while blocking the ongoing PHP2Shell vulnerability
# (CVE-2026-109618 and CVE-2026-109619). This is temporary: remove this ignore once it is lifted.
^https://dsi\.wisc\.edu/
# EPJ Web of Conferences DOIs redirect to epj-conferences.org, which returns 403 to scripted requests
^https://doi\.org/10\.1051/epjconf/
